WEBVTT

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:14.950
Here you go! Here you go!

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:18.500
Eat up!

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.120
Is it yummy, Akemi?

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:21.910
Hey!

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:22.620
You're so cute...

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.120
Hey, Genzo!

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.120
You're so cute...

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.410
When are you going to teach me

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.410
You're so cute...

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:27.950
how to be a pro wrestler?

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:27.950
You're so cute...

00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:32.790
You're gonna ask me that, are you?

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:38.250
I told you yesterday
that we'd start training at dawn!

00:00:41.830 --> 00:00:46.160
Hey! Wake up! It's time to start training!

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:57.790
Are you serious about this?

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:01.000
Yes! Yes! Yes, I am!

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.330
So let me go!

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:06.950
Then let's see how serious you are!

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:42.000
"Pride x Loyalty"

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:50.000
This is the design for the arena.

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:51.000
The pain!

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.160
We can hold

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:54.660
far more people than last time.

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:55.500
My bones are breaking!

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:57.290
They were flowing out into
the streets last time, after all.

00:02:57.290 --> 00:02:59.500
Please stop the pain!

00:02:57.290 --> 00:02:59.500
They were flowing out into
the streets last time, after all.

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:02.450
Please stop the pain!

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:02.450
I've placed VIP seats here.

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:07.120
They cost ten times as much
as the normal seats.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.250
I see!

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:09.580
Genzo, please...

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:12.200
Ten times!

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:13.620
Where are the food stands?

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:14.870
Why are we doing this? Why?

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:14.870
Where are the food stands?

00:03:14.870 --> 00:03:18.040
Why are we doing this? Why?

00:03:14.870 --> 00:03:18.040
Oh, they're around here.

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:20.330
Where around here, specifically?

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:22.120
This whole area.

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:30.290
We have two, no, almost three times
as many stands as last time.

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:31.370
Wonderful!

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:32.450
No more!

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:33.870
Food stalls!

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:33.870
No more!

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:34.410
Food stalls!

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:34.410
I think it's broken!

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:37.700
And we have so many people
wanting to sponsor.

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:37.700
I think it's broken!

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:39.410
I'm screaming with joy.

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:40.910
Really?

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:41.330
I can't do it! I don't think I can do it!

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:43.330
Now we just need to have

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:43.330
I can't do it! I don't think I can do it!

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:45.580
Genzo decide who'll be in the fights.

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:45.580
The body can't bend that way!

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:47.290
I'll tell him!

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:47.290
The body can't bend that way!

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:49.450
I'll be going, then.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:54.450
What's wrong? Out of the fight already?

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:56.660
The sunlight...

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:59.750
I don't see any sunlight.

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:03.160
I'm sick of this "weight lifting"
training anyway.

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:05.200
Teach me some moves!

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:06.660
Not a chance in hell!

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:10.330
You can't learn moves
without doing the lifting!

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:12.200
But there's no time...

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:13.660
Quit your whining!

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:16.870
You need to train your basic endurance
before you get in the ring!

00:04:16.870 --> 00:04:19.540
Genzo, you...

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:22.200
Don't you want to win?

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:29.080
Yeah.

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:31.290
This time, I want to win.

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:33.660
No, I have to win.

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:35.620
For my mistress's sake!

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:38.620
Excellent. So, Carmilla...

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:39.660
What?

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:42.620
About this person you want to defeat...

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:46.500
Just like my mistress, she's--

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:47.620
Hey!

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:51.500
I have a childhood friend named Joanna.

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:55.330
She has a servant named Rose
who Carmilla once fought,

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:57.370
and Carmilla got her ass kicked.

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:58.830
I see.

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:03.160
Hanako, I thought it might be
faster if you fought...

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:07.000
No, that won't do! As a vamp--

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:09.410
I can't get involved.

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:15.290
And I'll be busy checking out
all the new food stands!

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:16.950
Well, anyway.

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:23.040
It'll be hard to train her if I don't know
how strong her opponent is.

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:37.700
The time has come.

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:39.120
That's all there is to it.

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:43.580
It's time to show him what
a real wrestler looks like!

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:53.830
What is that?

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:56.120
You don't know, Rose?

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:57.160
Huh?

00:05:57.160 --> 00:06:00.450
That's the victory dance from his world.

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:22.500
Is that what that is?

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:28.950
If he's dancing like that before the
battle's even begun, he's sure to win!

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:30.830
Joanna!

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:36.370
I must defeat the hero,
and pay back Lindabulea, too.

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:38.040
Of course!

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:46.500
You lost once already?

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:51.410
Yes. And when I did,
I caused problems for my mistress.

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:55.500
It's my fault...

00:06:57.160 --> 00:07:00.200
I need vengeance.

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:03.250
Wait, Genzo...

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:07.120
You know that Demon King
from another world, right?

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:12.120
Yes. He was supposed to be
my last opponent in my old world.

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:13.620
What?

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:21.250
Genzo!

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:24.200
Demon King!

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:30.250
I see.

00:07:30.250 --> 00:07:33.370
So this fight means a lot to you, too.

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:36.160
I suppose so, yeah.

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:38.120
Genzo!

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:40.410
Coming!

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:42.330
Okay, train on your own for a while.

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:43.620
What?

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:46.750
You haven't taught me anything yet!

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:49.080
Do this.

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:53.750
Okay, but first I need a little break.

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:57.040
I've worked hard, I deserve this!

00:07:57.040 --> 00:08:00.870
You don't get any more
until the match is over.

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:02.410
Give it back!

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:04.830
Alcohol inhibits muscle metabolism!

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:06.290
I don't care!

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:09.080
Give it back, you pervert human!

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:11.750
You want to win, right?

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:24.620
So what will you do?

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:26.950
The line-up?

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:28.660
"1 Heat Haze, Celes"
"2 Orc King, Kobold"

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:28.660
I did come up with something...

00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:30.700
"3 Carmilla vs Rose"
"4 Genzo vs MAO"

00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:30.700
I did come up with something...

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:36.120
There were supposed to be five fights, right?

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:40.750
My demon beast army versus
your group! Five rounds!

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:43.870
And the last round is
a one-on-one between you and me!

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:44.700
Well?

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:47.040
Sounds great!

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:50.330
Yeah, that's the thing...

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:54.330
We need another match, don't we?

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:05.370
Calm down, fluffballs!

00:09:05.370 --> 00:09:08.870
What do you want? Just leave us alone!

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:11.540
I can't do that, fluffy cat girl!

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:14.370
Why?

00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:16.540
I need you.

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:22.040
I know you can do this.

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:23.580
You know we can do...

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:26.120
...what?

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:28.540
You want to be in a pro wrestling match?

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:33.000
No!

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.910
Quit your whining and come!

00:09:34.910 --> 00:09:38.370
I'm scared! I'm scared! I'm scared!

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:41.000
If you won't, I know what's in store for you!

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:42.200
No!

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:46.120
Who's a good boy? You are!

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:50.290
We'd get paid about this much, say?

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:51.410
No..

00:09:51.410 --> 00:09:53.200
This much.

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:55.580
We're in!

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:56.750
"1 Heat Haze Celes"
"2 Orc King, Kobold"
"3 Wolfgang, Misha"

00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:59.620
"4 Carmilla vs Rose"
"5 Genzo vs MAO"

00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:59.620
And that does it.

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:04.080
I think the first match is a little dull.

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:07.500
You're always so harsh.

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:11.910
The Hunter Guild gladly
accepted my offer, but...

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:15.160
What? Pro wrestling?

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:19.160
Of course you'd want the help of the strongest
hunter in the guild, demon beast--

00:10:20.830 --> 00:10:24.750
Teacher, let me do it too!

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:29.370
It's the first match, so I'd like
to really get the crowd riled up.

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:31.080
Good point.

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:34.910
Can we throw in somebody else
to make it a group match?

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:38.790
I heard the news, Genzo!

00:10:38.790 --> 00:10:41.700
The Demon King came here personally!

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:45.540
Just like a moth-wyvern to a dragon-flame!

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:47.950
Crush him, please!

00:10:47.950 --> 00:10:51.580
So, is there something I can do?

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:54.290
Just say the word!

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:55.790
That's it.

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:06.910
Come to our wrestling tournament!

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:10.000
Exciting battles await!

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:13.410
Lots of yummy food!

00:11:13.410 --> 00:11:18.410
The fights will be even better than last time!

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:26.700
There's more money to be made!

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:34.870
Right this way!

00:11:34.870 --> 00:11:37.700
Here you go!

00:11:34.870 --> 00:11:37.700
Yes! I got a good seat!

00:11:37.700 --> 00:11:39.540
<i>Takoyaki</i> !

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:48.000
No! No!

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:01.290
Tickets on sale over here!

00:12:01.290 --> 00:12:03.750
Please form two lines!

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:05.950
Monsters, come this way!

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:08.700
Please allow us to check
your personal belongings!

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:11.700
No weapons or magic items!

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:14.700
Today your fate will be decided!

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:17.040
That's my line, damn it!

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:19.700
Oh, you're here as well?

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:22.500
Good evening.

00:12:23.370 --> 00:12:25.410
Can you see, Maria?

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:26.830
I sure can!

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:30.000
But what is pro wrestling, exactly?

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.750
That's a good question.

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:34.620
Ikarumie Alimaran!

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:43.160
It's finally time!

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:46.250
Time to head backstage!

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:49.200
I'm sure everyone is all excited...

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.450
Huh? Hanako- <i>san</i> !

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:53.750
Hey!

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:56.910
Where's the gift shop?

00:12:56.910 --> 00:12:59.080
Oh, sorry.

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:02.410
I'm too busy to do it this time.

00:13:05.290 --> 00:13:07.620
Sorry!

00:13:08.790 --> 00:13:11.200
I'm all fired up!

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:13.660
Listen up, everyone.

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:15.290
It matters who wins and who loses.

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:19.910
But what matters more is to fight
in a way you won't regret!

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:24.290
Genzo's philosophy is wonderful.

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:26.330
Every word he says echoes in my heart.

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:30.790
Yeah! I won't forget his words!

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:33.870
If you win, you'll be getting
a good amount of prize money.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:35.870
So do your best.

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:38.410
Hey, were you listening?

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:41.500
It's not about winning, or money.

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:47.500
Yes. A true man does not concern
himself with such things.

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:50.040
Right, Genzo?

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:51.580
Correct.

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:55.830
With that prize money I can open
the pet shop of my dreams!

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:59.830
So I'm winning and getting
that cash no matter what!

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:02.040
That's not what you said...

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:04.370
It's time!

00:14:04.370 --> 00:14:07.580
It's a full house, guys!

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:10.540
Why do you look so upset?

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:12.620
That's a good thing.

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:17.040
But I don't want them
seeing me in this outfit...

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:19.000
Don't worry.

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.500
You've got this.

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:23.370
I don't want to wear that either!

00:14:23.370 --> 00:14:26.120
What is it, even?

00:14:29.370 --> 00:14:31.500
I need to win for my mistress's sake.

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:33.540
No matter what.

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:35.410
No.

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:37.120
Mistress?

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:40.620
You don't need to fight for my sake.

00:14:43.700 --> 00:14:46.830
Human t-shirts! Demon t-shirts!

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:49.580
Which will you pick?

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:57.330
It's time, everyone!

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.950
It's time for "Cluster Bank presents:

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:06.750
Team Hero Genzo versus
the Demon King's Army!"

00:15:08.160 --> 00:15:12.700
For our first match,
coming from Team Hero Genzo...

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:18.160
Heat Haze, the fake hero from the
Hunter Guild, and once again, Celes XXL!

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:23.620
And the mysterious masked warrior,
God Save the Queen At-lena!

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:30.250
I'm the princess!
Why do I have to dress like this?

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:39.950
Everyone's staring at me!
Their gazes pain me, but...

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:48.120
It's like a massage...
It hurts, but it feels good!

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:51.160
But... It's wonderful!

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:56.250
Facing them is the demon beast army!

00:15:56.250 --> 00:16:00.700
Will they show us the power
of the demon beasts?

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:04.580
We've got a great match for you tonight!

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:12.080
Come! I'll be your opponent!

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:14.830
Hit me with your hard body!

00:16:14.830 --> 00:16:16.950
What did you say, bouncy girl?

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:19.120
Hey, don't taunt him like that!

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:20.160
Calm down.

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:21.450
Calm down, please.

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:22.700
We need to come up with a strategy...

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:25.200
If you won't go to me, I'll go to you!

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:34.580
I've seen those buttocks before...

00:16:34.580 --> 00:16:36.330
Sure it's not Princess Buttocks?

00:16:36.330 --> 00:16:38.750
That's right! It's Princess Buttocks!

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:41.250
What humiliation!

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:45.950
I can hear the crowd's disgust with me...

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:00.660
One, two, three!

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:02.870
The winner is Team Genzo!

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:04.910
We did it, Teacher!

00:17:04.910 --> 00:17:08.580
It's finally time for me to get
the credit I deserve as the chosen hero!

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:12.290
Don't look at me like that, everyone!

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:14.830
The second match is beginning!

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:21.040
One, two, three!

00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:23.750
Winners, Team Genzo!

00:17:23.750 --> 00:17:25.370
We did it!

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:26.950
Hell yeah!

00:17:26.950 --> 00:17:31.700
A brainless brawl between
two groups of muscle-heads!

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:33.830
It's so intense!

00:17:33.830 --> 00:17:35.660
Honey...

00:17:38.250 --> 00:17:40.330
Bro...

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:42.200
Round three!

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:45.330
The winners are the Demon King's army!

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:49.290
Hey, entertain us!

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:52.950
This is why I didn't want to do this...

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:03.290
Now, our next match features
the drunk loser girl

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:07.830
who goes to sleep holding
other women's clothes: Carmilla!

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:10.250
And her opponent, the black knight

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:16.580
who'll do anything and take
any risk for her lady, Rose!

00:18:16.580 --> 00:18:19.000
Let the battle begin!

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:24.080
I've already proved that a lesser vampire
can't beat an elder vampire!

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:26.040
Shut up!

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:31.370
What?

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:34.620
What's going on?

00:18:37.540 --> 00:18:39.750
Damn you, lesser!

00:18:42.750 --> 00:18:45.580
This is an amazing fight!

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:47.080
Get her!

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:49.160
Don't lose!

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:55.120
She's weaker than you!

00:18:55.120 --> 00:18:56.500
Beat her quick!

00:18:56.500 --> 00:19:00.040
Listen, focus on your opponent!

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:04.450
No matter how strong they are,
they'll let their guard down!

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:06.160
Watch for your moment!

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:11.700
I can't lose! I can't!

00:19:11.700 --> 00:19:13.790
She's a coward who does nothing but run!

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:16.330
Show her how to fight!

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:27.410
Go!

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:30.370
What?

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:41.290
Did I win?

00:19:41.290 --> 00:19:42.660
Yes!

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:53.080
I defeated an elder vampire?

00:19:55.700 --> 00:19:57.450
I did it!

00:19:57.450 --> 00:19:59.290
I won!

00:19:59.290 --> 00:20:00.120
What are you doing?

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:01.750
Pin her!

00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:05.750
Mistress, I did it!

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:07.160
Carmilla!

00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:16.080
One...

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:19.120
...two...

00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:20.700
...three!

00:20:22.040 --> 00:20:24.790
The winner is Rose!

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:30.580
Well done!

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:33.700
Of course...

00:20:33.700 --> 00:20:35.330
I lost.

00:20:36.410 --> 00:20:40.160
You'll never beat me.

00:20:42.750 --> 00:20:44.330
You let your guard down.

00:20:44.330 --> 00:20:47.160
Why did you give her an opening?

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:51.790
But it was a good fight.

00:21:05.080 --> 00:21:06.950
Mistress?

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:11.790
Carmilla, you fought for your own sake,

00:21:11.790 --> 00:21:15.580
with your pride on the line, and you won.

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:19.540
No, Mistress... I...

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:22.540
I lost!

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:24.040
No.

00:21:26.290 --> 00:21:29.750
To me, it was a victory.

00:21:29.750 --> 00:21:34.120
And I'm proud of you.

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:36.620
Here's your reward.

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:41.700
Mistress!

00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:44.040
You're such a crybaby.

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:50.950
Mistress gave me food for the first time!

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:53.160
Is that what it was?

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:59.450
Genzo Shibata, no, Animal Mask!

00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:05.830
It's been a long time
since anybody's called me that.

00:22:05.830 --> 00:22:09.040
It's time to fight!

00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:12.540
I'm getting excited!

00:23:45.790 --> 00:23:48.250
Next Time: "Hero x Demon King."

00:23:48.250 --> 00:23:49.870
Make sure you watch it, okay?
